permission-tickets-manage = Manage panels, ticket members, assignees and names; view stats
permission-tickets-use = Open and close your ticket, and resend its form answers
config-tickets-panels = Named ticket panels. Button messages show 25 panels each; select messages show 125. Larger lists use multiple messages.
